# Backend rules

- Follow existing route handler patterns under `app/api/**/route.ts`.
- Authenticate with `requireAuthUser()` or Clerk `auth()` unless the route is listed in `lib/public-routes.ts`.
- Validate inputs; return explicit HTTP status codes and JSON errors.
- Scope Prisma queries by authenticated `user.id` (or `image.userId` for versions).
- For AI routes accepting `imageUrl`, use ownership checks (`lib/verify-user-image.ts`) before credits or fetches.
- Never expose secrets (Cloudinary, Stripe, Anthropic, Replicate, UploadThing) to the client.
- Respect credit costs (`constants/credits.ts`) and rate limiting patterns in sibling routes.
- Avoid new public API surface unless the task requires it.
- Webhooks must verify signatures (Clerk Svix, Stripe) before side effects.
